00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:07.600
<b>We can call home now that we found our stuff!</b>

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.230
<b>Let's hope we get reception out here.</b>

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.730
<b>The Dragon Priestess</b>

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.730
<b>The Dragon Priestess</b>

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:13.730
<b>The Dragon Priestess</b>

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.730
<b>H-Hey, what is that?</b>

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.990
<b>We can talk to people in Biscotti and Galette with these.</b>

00:02:18.820 --> 00:02:19.900
<b>Shinku?</b>

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:21.660
<b>Shinku!</b>

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:23.280
<b>Princess!</b>

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:25.240
<b>I'm glad I got through!</b>

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:28.910
<b>Shinku!</b>

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.870
<b>Nanami-san!</b>

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:33.500
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:34.460
<b>Are you all right?</b>

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.250
<b>Yes!</b>

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.800
<b>I'm really sorry we're late, Princess.</b>

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.680
<b>It's all right!</b>

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.720
<b>So, where are you right now?</b>

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:47.180
<b>All three of the countries just sent out search parties.</b>

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:49.730
<b>Uh, well...</b>

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.690
<b>Where are we again?</b>

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:55.480
<b>The Dragons' Forest of Corne Heights, in South Flonyard.</b>

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:56.440
<b>Yeah, there.</b>

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.030
<b>Good, we're not that far away.</b>

00:03:00.030 --> 00:03:04.370
<b>We should be able to pick you up within the day.</b>

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:05.320
<b>Great!</b>

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:06.830
<b>And, um...</b>

00:03:06.830 --> 00:03:09.120
<b>Right, introductions!</b>

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.330
<b>Char!</b>

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:19.170
<b>This girl saved our lives.</b>

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.510
<b>M-My name is Char.</b>

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.880
<b>I am a Dragon Priestess.,</b>

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:29.020
<b>I am Millhiore Filianno Biscotti, ruler of Biscotti.</b>

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:34.230
<b>Thank you very much for saving Shinku and Nanami-san.</b>

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.020
<b>I-It was my pleasure!</b>

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:44.490
<b>We'll be heading to the edge of
your Forest to retrieve our heroes.</b>

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.910
<b>Would we be encroaching your forest by doing so?</b>

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.910
<b>N-No! It's okay!</b>

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.960
<b>...so, we made it!</b>

00:03:55.960 --> 00:03:58.250
<b>That's very good to hear.</b>

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.420
<b>We're all relieved.</b>

00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.800
<b>Sorry for causing so much ruckus.</b>

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:06.010
<b>Gaul and his squadron have already left to find you.</b>

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.050
<b>We'll catch up to him as quickly as possible.</b>

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:10.430
<b>Okay, thanks!</b>

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:15.730
<b>I'm glad they were okay!</b>

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.770
<b>Of course!</b>

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:19.860
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:22.110
<b>No need to worry, we're fine now!</b>

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:27.410
<b>We're headed your way with our high-speed air force!</b>

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.160
<b>We'll be there in just a few short minutes!</b>

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:31.700
<b>Just hold on a little longer.</b>

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.830
<b>Thanks so much, Cou-sama and Becky.</b>

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:38.000
<b>Oh, but there's no need to rush.</b>

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.510
<b>We want to explore the area a bit while we wait.</b>

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:43.880
<b>Right!</b>

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:48.840
<b>Dragon Priestess, look after those two for me, okay?</b>

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.760
<b>Y-Yes, your highness!</b>

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.540
<b>Wow!</b>

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.160
<b>There used to be twice as much water flowing here.</b>

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:19.960
<b>Two times more than <i>this?!</i></b>

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:26.720
<b>Are there dragons here, too?</b>

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:27.550
<b>Yes.</b>

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.090
<b>I don't see any, though.</b>

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.360
<b>That is the local Divinegon.</b>

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.280
<b>She controls the water and lightning in this area.</b>

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:53.660
<b>Oh, man...</b>

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:55.160
<b>Wow...</b>

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:05.380
<b>Divinegons govern the gifts of the land,</b>

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.420
<b>such as water, fire, wind, and flora.</b>

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:10.220
<b>So they're like the Local Deities?</b>

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.100
<b>Perhaps they're similar for humans,</b>

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.180
<b>but not for those like me.</b>

00:06:15.510 --> 00:06:19.140
<b>Dragons embody all of the life on this continent.</b>

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:20.440
<b>Cool...</b>

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.070
<b>This is pretty intense, but...</b>

00:06:24.320 --> 00:06:27.690
<b>Is it usually even crazier?</b>

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:28.530
<b>Yes.</b>

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:34.410
<b>That is the Flame Dragon.</b>

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.700
<b>It bestows life to the ground with the power of the volcanoes.</b>

00:06:58.720 --> 00:07:00.430
<b>S-Sorry!</b>

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:01.520
<b>Whatever.</b>

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:07.530
<b>Dragons used to be symbols for natural disasters</b>

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.740
<b>because they caused storms and volcanic eruptions.</b>

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:11.990
<b>Really?</b>

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:17.490
<b>But soon, we realized that areas hit by these disasters</b>

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:21.040
<b>would rise up much stronger than before.</b>

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.290
<b>I think Rico-chan told me about that before!</b>

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:32.300
<b>They say that Dragons exist to restore balance to mother nature, which was disrupted by humans.</b>

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.590
<b>Wow...</b>

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:38.430
<b>Dragon Priestesses are the ones who help humans communicate with these Dragons.</b>

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:44.310
<b>They inform us of any Dragon activity
 so that we can avoid fighting with Dragons,</b>

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:48.270
<b>and sometimes guide Dragons to give
 their blessing to lands that are in bad shape.</b>

00:07:48.270 --> 00:07:50.190
<b>That's amazing!</b>

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.200
<b>I see.</b>

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:56.320
<b>It must have been a rough day for them.</b>

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:02.080
<b>I've been told not to take any action, since they both seem to be fine.</b>

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.210
<b>That's good.</b>

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.960
<b>It's hard to believe that they fell into the Dragons' Forest, of all places.</b>

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:12.590
<b>It'll definitely help spread the heroes' names.</b>

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:18.600
<b>Rumor is that there are demons there, so I can't say I'm <i>not</i> worried...</b>

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.600
<b>In the Dragons' Forest?!</b>

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:25.850
<b>Yukikaze, tell me everything you know about that.</b>

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:27.900
<b>O-Okay.</b>

00:08:34.150 --> 00:08:36.360
<b>This is our home.</b>

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:40.200
<b>This is not too deep into the forest,</b>

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:44.160
<b>so a crowd of humans should not startle the Dragons.</b>

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.420
<b>There shouldn't be any predators around here either,</b>

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:49.000
<b>so this is a good place to wait for your friends.</b>

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.750
<b>Oh yeah,</b>

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:55.130
<b>were those things that were attacking you...</b>

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.680
<b>Demons.</b>

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.810
<b>They started appearing around the end of summer.</b>

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:08.560
<b>They attack Dragons and harm the animals of the forest.</b>

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:12.820
<b>The Dragons are afraid of them,</b>

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.070
<b>and that has disturbed nature greatly.</b>

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:19.820
<b>So the ones we defeated weren't the only ones?</b>

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:22.580
<b>No matter how many I slay, they won't stop coming.</b>

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.750
<b>I think they are being created somewhere in the forest.</b>

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:34.710
<b>Their "Mother" raises them using the
 life force of the forest and the Dragons.</b>

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:38.090
<b>We have to find it and destroy it.</b>

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:42.430
<b>The Dragons have been very kind to me</b>

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:43.930
<b>because I am a Dragon Priestess.</b>

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.890
<b>The time has come for <i>me</i> to help <i>them.</i></b>

00:09:47.890 --> 00:09:50.350
<b>Then we'd be happy to help!</b>

00:09:50.350 --> 00:09:52.650
<b>It's a hero's job to beat up demons!</b>

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:57.280
<b>This is a Dragon Priestess's duty.</b>

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:00.530
<b>Humans should take no part in this.</b>

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.700
<b>I'll be fine on my own.</b>

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.290
<b>I've made it this far, after all.</b>

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.370
<b>Char...</b>

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:17.630
<b>It's here!</b>

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:23.010
<b>It's roaring because we slew its brethren.</b>

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:25.140
<b>It's not too far away!</b>

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:26.600
<b>We'll help out!</b>

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.390
<b>Stay here, Heroes!</b>

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.560
<b>This has nothing to do with you!</b>

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.360
<b>Stay here! Understood?</b>

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.060
<b>Wow.</b>

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.980
<b>She's an archer, huh?</b>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.360
<b>Was that a Sign Spell, too?</b>

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.100
<b>Hero-sama...</b>

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:30.810
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.060
<b>I told you to stay put.</b>

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:39.110
<b>Well, we wanted in on the action too!</b>

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:42.480
<b>Boomerang Blade...</b>

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:43.820
<b>Go!</b>

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:58.080
<b>Oh no! There's too many!</b>

00:12:58.080 --> 00:12:59.590
<b>Don't worry.</b>

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:13.890
<b>We're here!</b>

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:19.270
<b>Pastillage's Flying Knights are here to save the day!</b>

00:13:25.610 --> 00:13:26.610
<b>They're...</b>

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.200
<b>I'm glad we made it!</b>

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:31.700
<b>Indeed!</b>

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:34.790
<b>Now, let's get rid of those demons!</b>

00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:35.620
<b>Yeah!</b>

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:37.870
<b>Go, Flying Knights!</b>

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.120
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.310
<b>Wow...</b>

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:01.650
<b>It's a whole squad of knights riding birds.</b>

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.400
<b>Those are Pastillage's Flying Knights.</b>

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.030
<b>Shinku! Nanami!</b>

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.410
<b>Becky!</b>

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.410
<b>Becky!</b>

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.410
<b>I'm glad you're okay!</b>

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.790
<b>You're Char-san, the Dragon Priestess, right?</b>

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:19.160
<b>Y-Yes.</b>

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:23.290
<b>We're very sorry for encroaching on your skies.</b>

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:29.050
<b>The Biscotti, Galette, and Pastillage Alliance will be sure to slay each and every demon in the forest.</b>

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.930
<b>An alliance? Then that means...</b>

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:33.180
<b>Yep!</b>

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.060
<b>Can you see the heroes, Rico?</b>

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:43.480
<b>I see them!</b>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.570
<b>Hero-sama!</b>

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.320
<b>Rico, Eclair!</b>

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.030
<b>There's a lot of them.</b>

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:55.160
<b>No kidding.</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:15:01.670
<b>Well, these sad little demons should be a piece of cake for the Galette knights!</b>

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:02.750
<b>You said it!</b>

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:07.500
<b>All right! Bring it on!</b>

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:09.970
<b>Y'all are going down, down, down!</b>

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:12.630
<b>Double...</b>

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.010
<b>Lightning...</b>

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.310
<b>Blast!</b>

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.310
<b>Blast!</b>

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.690
<b>That's Gaul and Génoise!</b>

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:27.360
<b>Looks like all the advance teams are here.</b>

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:30.490
<b>We should be able to take care of this with ease.</b>

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.150
<b>R-Right...</b>

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.410
<b>So, our wonderful hero, Shinku...</b>

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.160
<b>Y-Yeah?</b>

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:43.330
<b>Aren't you being a bit <i>too</i> friendly with the Dragon Priestess?</b>

00:15:45.580 --> 00:15:47.920
<b>S-S-Sorry!</b>

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.670
<b>N-No, it's...</b>

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.260
<b>I was, you know, protecting you, and...</b>

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:55.180
<b>Y-Yes, I know.</b>

00:15:56.800 --> 00:16:01.270
<b>It seems like Liscia and her team has the skies covered.</b>

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:02.560
<b>Yes.</b>

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:08.980
<b>Unfortunately, it looks like there are more demons hiding somewhere.</b>

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:10.320
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:15.360
<b>All demons in sight have been defeated!</b>

00:16:15.360 --> 00:16:17.160
<b>No more appear to be approaching!</b>

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.410
<b>Cool!</b>

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:21.790
<b>Aria, Lucy, keep searching.</b>

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:23.960
<b>Everyone else, gather down below!</b>

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.830
<b>Roger!</b>

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:24.830
<b>Roger!</b>

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.830
<b>Gotta give our regards to the Dragon Priestess!</b>

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.340
<b>Hero-sama!</b>

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.590
<b>Rico!</b>

00:16:31.590 --> 00:16:33.800
<b>Sorry I worried you.</b>

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:36.300
<b>As long as you're fine!</b>

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.930
<b>Don't say that to <i>us!</i></b>

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.430
<b>You had our Princess worried sick!</b>

00:16:40.810 --> 00:16:42.430
<b>You're our hero!</b>

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:44.560
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.560
<b>Thanks, guys.</b>

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.020
<b>Well, as long as you're all right.</b>

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:49.940
<b>That's right.</b>

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.490
<b>Thanks for coming out here.</b>

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:01.700
<b>Thank you so much for your help.</b>

00:16:58.490 --> 00:16:59.740
<b>No problem.</b>

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:02.660
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.410
<b>Gotta help those in need, right?</b>

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.830
<b>We're honored to meet you, Dragon Priestess.</b>

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.550
<b>Please, have a drink.</b>

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.960
<b>They're Sachi Fruits.</b>

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.890
<b>Here you go!</b>

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.180
<b>But, man! What a day, huh?</b>

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.150
<b>Tell me about it.</b>

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:30.520
<b>Thanks for coming to help, Gaul.</b>

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.860
<b>No problem!</b>

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.530
<b>Whoa, this is delicious!</b>

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.530
<b>Seriously!</b>

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.200
<b>Priestess-sama!</b>

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.790
<b>Do you have a moment?</b>

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:48.620
<b>I'm one of Galette's demon slayers.</b>

00:17:48.620 --> 00:17:50.420
<b>Rico here is...</b>

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:53.300
<b>I am a scientist at the Royal Academy.</b>

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.880
<b>Is it about those demons?</b>

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.180
<b>Yes.</b>

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:08.060
<b>We've never heard of demons that attack 
Dragons and steal power from Divinegons.</b>

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:12.810
<b>We're afraid that these demons are much
more dangerous than ones we've faced before.</b>

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:19.950
<b>There is an old legend that all Dragon
Priestesses and Dragon Riders are told...</b>

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.030
<b>When there are demons that devour Dragons,</b>

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:26.200
<b>the Dragon Priestess shall sacrifice herself to slay them.</b>

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.870
<b>That is the fate of a Dragon Priestess.</b>

00:18:28.870 --> 00:18:31.750
<b>One who lives with Dragons, with the help of Dragons.</b>

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:36.460
<b>I'm glad I could help guide the heroes home.</b>

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.090
<b>It's almost nightfall.</b>

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:43.850
<b>Spend the night at my place and leave early tomorrow morning.</b>

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.440
<b>Hold it, Hero!</b>

00:18:58.280 --> 00:18:59.190
<b>Over here!</b>

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.950
<b>It's not too far.</b>

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.070
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:04.450
<b>Hero!</b>

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:17.670
<b>It appears that the Priestess doesn't know much, either.</b>

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:21.170
<b>We couldn't collect any useful information.</b>

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.930
<b>Thanks for trying.</b>

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:27.350
<b>However, from our own investigation,</b>

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:32.190
<b>we discovered that the demons we fought were local creatures that were transformed into demons.</b>

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.190
<b>The mother demon is likely somewhere in the forest.</b>

00:19:35.480 --> 00:19:39.690
<b>We need to defeat it, and save the Dragons.</b>

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:43.410
<b>Good observations, Rico and Noir.</b>

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:48.950
<b>We asked some experts about
what it is that we might be facing.</b>

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:53.210
<b>They're neck-high in research right now!</b>

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:59.710
<b>Man, and I thought we had today off.</b>

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:01.720
<b>Those heroes just keep bringing trouble.</b>

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:04.470
<b>Quit your complaining!</b>

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.850
<b>Our descendants are in trouble!</b>

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.390
<b>Thank you for your help.</b>

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:13.730
<b>From the looks of it, this is a parasitic demon we're facing.</b>

00:20:13.730 --> 00:20:18.480
<b>It should be in the form of a plant, 
so killing it should be easy once we find it.</b>

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:23.240
<b>I'm just concerned that it can sap power from Divinegons.</b>

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:25.360
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.120
<b>Could it be...</b>

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.870
<b>Hey, Kid, connect us to our little one right now!</b>

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:35.920
<b>Send out the elite armies and air forces immediately.</b>

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:40.630
<b>Request immediate assistance from Galette and Biscotti!</b>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.630
<b>Y-Yessir!</b>

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.170
<b>What exactly is...</b>

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.640
<b>It's a war.</b>

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:51.260
<b>A war against a horde of demons coming from the Dragons' Forest.</b>

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:55.270
<b>If we don't hurry, the entire <i>continent</i> will be in danger!</b>

00:20:57.730 --> 00:20:59.520
<b>Mobile forces, assemble!</b>

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.650
<b>Yessir!</b>

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:04.240
<b>This is <i>not</i> a war show!</b>

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.650
<b>We are departing to slay demons!</b>

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:06.660
<b>Yessir!</b>

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.030
<b>Do not be afraid!</b>

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:11.830
<b>Remain in formation, follow the plan,</b>

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:15.160
<b>defeat all enemies, and defend your allies!</b>

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.290
<b>Sir!</b>

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:18.750
<b>Biscotti Knights, First Army...</b>

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:19.500
<b>Move out!</b>

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:29.140
<b>There seem to be more and more
fateful events connected to our hero.</b>

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:35.430
<b>This time, he's fighting demons alongside a Dragon Priestess.</b>

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:36.140
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:39.400
<b>It seems like trouble just comes to find him.</b>

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:41.770
<b>He is a hero, after all.</b>

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:48.660
<b>He simply gravitates toward those that need his help.</b>

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.410
<b>Don't worry...</b>

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:55.450
<b>The Tripartite Alliance will be with you soon!</b>

